Windings, poles, slots, harmonics and manufacture (@pe-windings: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electrical-power-engineering, #source "../sources/Electric-Machines-MIT-6-685.lingua#r_6A4HM4XV13NAZDRV92PZDJ31XH", #source "../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30", #source "../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP", #electrical-power-engineering "../../../physics/electromagnetism/induction/Motors-generators-transformers-and-energy-accounts.lingua#r_3G4DF28F72Y3GD5QRG19CD75W8") { r_67S1SDAHWDDYJTXXCDAYGD9MM7
**Read:** [Electric Machines — MIT 6.685, Fall 2013](../sources/Electric-Machines-MIT-6-685.lingua#r_6A4HM4XV13NAZDRV92PZDJ31XH), chapters 5 and 11 in full, with complete winding problems; [Hydrogenerator Design Manual — Bureau of Reclamation](../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30), complete winding/construction development; [Motor rewind studies and good practice — EASA/AEMT](../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP), both complete studies and the separate authorized good-practice guide.

Derive the spatial magnetomotive-force distribution of a coil, then a distributed/polyphase winding. Specify pole pairs, slots, turns, pitch, phase belt, connection and current directions. Winding factor and space harmonics arise from a real arrangement of conductors, not an arbitrary correction multiplied into an otherwise unrelated machine formula.

Draw a complete small winding plan and verify phase sequence, resultant rotating field, flux linkage and induced voltage with the same conventions. Compare concentrated/distributed and short-pitched alternatives, including harmonic, end-winding, resistance, leakage and manufacturing effects. Preserve conductor area, insulation, slot fill, thermal path, mechanical support and connection evidence.

Read the complete [Electric Machines — MIT 6.685, Fall 2013](../sources/Electric-Machines-MIT-6-685.lingua#r_6A4HM4XV13NAZDRV92PZDJ31XH) winding/design chapters and [Hydrogenerator Design Manual — Bureau of Reclamation](../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30) design account, then the entire [Motor rewind studies and good practice — EASA/AEMT](../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP) report and authorized good-practice method for a repair comparison. Test a winding-resistance, loss or harmonic prediction independently. A correct electromagnetic winding calculation does not establish that the manufactured insulation, impregnation, joints or assembly meet the intended condition. Appropriate supervised workshop/test evidence is a distinct part of practical capability.

**Continue:** [Motors, generators, transformers and energy accounts](../../../physics/electromagnetism/induction/Motors-generators-transformers-and-energy-accounts.lingua#r_3G4DF28F72Y3GD5QRG19CD75W8).

